2026-11-07T06:45:15.0302330Z 
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0303170Z I will:
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0304310Z 
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0305910Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0307110Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0308450Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0309600Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0310330Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0311130Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0312200Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0313140Z    /var/root
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0372480Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0374500Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0420100Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0421550Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0422500Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-11-07T06:45:15.0423890Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
